      "id": 4,
      "title": "How to Create Your Garden Haven For Birds",
      "excerpt": "In these far-off lands, the birds have been facing many problems in relation to habitat destruction, urbanization, climate change, and the scarcity of food. Through informed decision-making when it comes to bird-feeding habits, plant choice, and outdoor space allocation, it is possible to make our gardens a haven for birds.",
